        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kagan tingkwm hei tat the,",
            "Rianra bammei nun guai;",
            "Neihriu gaimei kandi mun guai tei,",
            "Matat khatna khou ‘maan dat nimei ram e.",
            "",
            "He! atingsaeng namdaih neihla pui ram,",
            "Kanloumei nanun bampui ram ‘zuan o;",
            "Rianra mei le talan patmei,",
            "Naidat lak khe kapmei rianramei guai.",
            "",
            "2. He kandi rianra mei le,",
            "Mikdui ruina luanglyam;",
            "Rianra kalangh bampui ram khou hei,",
            "Pat louna tatni e kanlou mei ram khou.",
            "",
            "3. Rianra mei guai tuan lana,",
            "Kandih munpuang guaini;",
            "Kandih neihla mei guai maan puni,",
            "Munpuang kumhmei tingsaeng ram ta ai ning e."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
